{"title":"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Medians <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/c/13c970cbf5e2e7029089517d5e8efbb8cade6d8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> intersect in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" />. The midpoint of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/6/9a65c05bd85d2609bea5db2b109ed5f556463511.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE$\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />. \nLet the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/b/47b9fdcd5e8eba806dcb1a8d08bb8bc6c921abcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle MNE$\" width=\"66\" height=\"13\" /> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> times the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/f/cff46c993e503ac59bbfd20cb73856e3ab8e0358.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{1}{6}\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{1}{8}\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{1}{9}\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{1}{12}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{1}{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"385\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/d/37d7697db97be10f40f389a118a7b33a79ddd3f1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy]  draw((0,0)--(120,0)--(40,60)--(0,0)); draw((40,60)--(60,0)); draw((120,0)--(20,30)); draw((160/3,20)--(30,45)); dot((40,60)); label(&quot;A&quot;,(40,60),N); dot((0,0)); label(&quot;B&quot;,(0,0),SW); dot((120,0)); label(&quot;C&quot;,(120,0),SE); dot((60,0)); label(&quot;D&quot;,(60,0),S); dot((20,30)); label(&quot;E&quot;,(20,30),NW); dot((160/3,20)); label(&quot;M&quot;,(160/3,20),NE); dot((30,45)); label(&quot;N&quot;,(30,45),NW);  draw((160/3,20)--(0,0),dotted);  [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"152\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/4/2a423062f56e5ac793c71390e57d0e5eedde5eea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[NME] = a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"94\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/6/78684ec5fd083b86665b2004c803a7463aabaf1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[BMD] = b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"92\" height=\"18\" />.  The altitudes and bases of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/d/41dee852fd3fdac25684898327bf02aaf79744cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ANM$\" width=\"65\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/4/994155751e4b6e795da071869f531ea3ff3b0179.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle NME$\" width=\"66\" height=\"13\" /> are the same, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/b/9fb6ae13c67c8fe9233a2c4b5a53b57974d1740e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[NME] = [ANM] = a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"178\" height=\"18\" />.  Since the base of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/c/f6c6417c24a498597c6a18c8d369ebb29c7c2071.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle BEM$\" width=\"64\" height=\"13\" /> is twice as long as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/4/994155751e4b6e795da071869f531ea3ff3b0179.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle NME$\" width=\"66\" height=\"13\" /> and the altitudes of both triangles are the same, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/a/b4ab370b7365803d69cb0163ae5f4a11cb8840a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[BEM] = 2a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"101\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Since the altitudes and bases of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/0/f40d4b623f09de3b401d9410b641d454b9629278.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle BMD$\" width=\"65\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/7/1a784a08bdec9be9458549e71052f6be6d79aa3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle CMD$\" width=\"65\" height=\"13\" /> are the same, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/e/72e99ac35e4abe024e4b72e501ffcf792553b2ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[BMD] = [CMD] = b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"176\" height=\"18\" />.  Additionally, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/9/0b97d5e6d663a54035d16ce34566969c20b57636.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AME$\" width=\"63\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/b/9eb3e5f11bd9fa7f9c96e7019ed976e32c667c09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle EMB$\" width=\"64\" height=\"13\" /> have the same area, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/3/3431b35dcd263cac56e5c8a8aed399ba0ce6fce2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AMC$\" width=\"63\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/a/0faed260933ee64e9300b5750492d63184fc7687.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle BMC$\" width=\"64\" height=\"13\" /> also have the same area, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/b/e4bf27140020f103a7964fe02bae019c23229378.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[AMC] = 2b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"99\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Also, the altitudes and bases of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/5/f75d6d58b03031bd7cb52a7ca886a8ddf369d21c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/e/b8eabc87afe4c11a47e4aa27628d5517af4866b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ADC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> are the same, so the area of the two triangles are the same.  Thus,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/c/0bc33929b8b9cd9a598b5e62e5b0562652a4cf08.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a+a+2a+b=2b+b\\]\" width=\"183\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/e/93ec12b69c81c9ef7be844d4351a62837db02864.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4a=2b\\]\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/a/b6a65f467256eb70e9d3067cfc54c12e0b2867cf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2a = b\\]\" width=\"50\" height=\"12\" />\nThus, the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/4/7849ec73caa471e93880fb165daa7237331b1095.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12a$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" />, so the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/4/994155751e4b6e795da071869f531ea3ff3b0179.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle NME$\" width=\"66\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/0/e10f7b229549d9afbdef6ae2862bc89bacfe16cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" /> the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />.  The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/3/693c4044f8526a8179956e8ac7a3f2f9d61e2c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"43\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME\" title=\"1961 AHSME\">1961 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1961 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a r